      "failure_scenario": "Wage inflation surges (as it did in FY2022 with attrition hitting ~27%), visa costs rise, and sub-contracting expenses increase, compressing EBIT margins by 200-300 bps. This would break the assumption that the FY2021 PAT growth rate is a reliable forward proxy, causing net income to grow far more slowly than revenue.",
